id: GO-SEC-027
title: HTTP handler missing security headers
category: security
severity: info
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .go
  exclude_paths: test/ vendor/ _test.go
patterns:
  - regex: func.*http\.HandlerFunc|func.*ServeHTTP
    message: "HTTP handler detected — ensure security headers are set (HSTS, X-Content-Type-Options, X-Frame-Options)"
fix: Use middleware to set security headers. Consider chi.middleware or custom middleware.
